WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.980
Adventurers'            Academy

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.670
I'm the third daughter of the Overweg family,

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:18.450
the instructors of the martial arts 
in the Dukedom of Bleichröder,

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.380
Louise Jolande Aurelia Overweg.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:26.770
I've studied the Magic Fist Style
 since I was little...

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:29.640
<i>I've spent the last seven 
years at home in solitude.</i>

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.420
<i>I've kept my distance from others</i>

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.840
<i>and lived by myself to prevent 
any succession issues.</i>

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.020
I'm the third daughter of 
the Hillenbrand family,

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:42.600
the instructors of spearmanship 
in the Dukedom of Bleichröder,

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.810
Iina Susanne Hillenbrand.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.300
My talent with the spear was recognized,

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.580
and that's why I'm in this scholarship 
class at the Adventurers' Academy.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:54.370
<i>But thanks to that, my communication 
skills have hit rock bottom.</i>

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.160
<i>Just calm down.</i>

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.690
<i>This is where my story starts.</i>

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:02.700
<i>My story about making friends!</i>

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:05.300
All right, the next one is our last.

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:07.260
Baumeister.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:08.630
Yes, sir!

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:12.660
I'm the eighth son of the 
Baumeister Knightdom,

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:15.300
Wendelin von Benno Baumeister.

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:18.640
I'd be happy if you would call me "Well."

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:21.030
I look forward to our time together.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:34.280
All right, now I'll explain the curriculum 
for this scholarship class.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.820
<i>Maybe announcing a nickname 
was going too far?</i>

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:41.610
We'll start by discussing this.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.660
Name

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.660
Specialty

