00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:53.270
Next month, you'll begin training in parties.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:57.630
Make sure you decide who you'll be 
joining up with on your own before then.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.310
<i>I guess it's like choosing groups?</i>

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.970
<i>I suck at that.</i>

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:32.130
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:32.130
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

